# Google Maps Platform API Key (SvelteKit public dynamic env var)
#
# Quickstart for Prototyping (No Billing / No Cloud Project Required):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms.
# 3. Click to generate/reveal your free Maps Demo Key.
# 4. Copy the key and paste it below into your local `.env` file (never commit `.env`).
#
# For Production:
# - Create a key in Google Cloud Console: https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# - Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Elevation API
# - Restrict the key by HTTP referrer / server IP and API restrictions:
#   https://docs.cloud.google.com/api-keys/docs/add-restrictions-api-keys?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# Optional: Dedicated server-only key for SvelteKit /api/* BFF proxy routes.
# If omitted, server routes fall back to PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY.
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_server_api_key_here
